38184>>>>>    Procedure SetActionButtons
38187>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38187>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38187>>>>>        Boolean bHasRecord
38187>>>>>        Handle hoDD
38187>>>>>
38187>>>>>        Get Server to hoDD
38188>>>>>        Get GetNavigateData to NavigateData
38189>>>>>        Get HasRecord of hoDD to bHasRecord
38190>>>>>
38190>>>>>        // let's hide all buttons and then Show the ones we want
38190>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to False
38191>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to False
38192>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to False
38193>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to False
38194>>>>>
38194>>>>>        If (NavigateData.bReadOnly) Begin
38196>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to True
38197>>>>>        End
38197>>>>>>
38197>>>>>        Else Begin
38198>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
38199>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
38200>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
38201>>>>>        End
38201>>>>>>
38201>>>>>    End_Procedure
